invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_sign_pack.c
catches: mldsa_signer_test
reason: RejBoundedPoly's compaction runs nine passes in place of ten, so
  a kept value whose move is 512 or more stays 512 positions too high.
  SHAKE256's streams reject one half-byte in 16, so no key generation
  reads such a move, and no known answer sees it. bin/mldsa_signer_test
  feeds streams whose first 700 to 708 half-bytes are rejected and
  requires the branching loop's coefficients.

--- old
    for (unsigned bit = 0; bit < MLDS_ETA_PASSES; bit++) {
--- new
    for (unsigned bit = 0; bit + 1 < MLDS_ETA_PASSES; bit++) {
